  "question": {
    "text": "If the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>|</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mover><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> represents a circle where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi></math> are real constants then which of the following condition is correct?"
  },
