      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;",
