  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>|</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mover><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mrow><mover><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mover><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mi>z</mi></math></p><p>Then,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>z</mi><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></math>or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mover><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is the equation of circle.&nbsp;</p><p>Centre&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>radius,&#160;</mtext><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;for the equation to represent circle.</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>-</mo><mo>{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>}</mo></math></p>"
  }
